  "Assignments: Problem Sets and Solutions": "과제: 문제 세트와 해답",
  "html:An asset rises from 100 to 108 and pays a distribution of 2. Its total simple return is 10%. Calculate its log return and compare the two measures.": "একটি সম্পদের মূল্য ১০০ থেকে ১০৮-এ বৃদ্ধি পায় এবং ২ একক লভ্যাংশ দেয়। এর মোট সরল রিটার্ন ১০%। লগ রিটার্ন গণনা করে দুটি পরিমাপের তুলনা করুন।",
  "html:Load adjusted price data, compute simple and log returns, annualize means and volatility under an explicitly stated frequency assumption, and compare arithmetic and geometric annualized performance. Check missing dates and corporate-action treatment.": "সমন্বিত মূল্য ডেটা লোড করুন, simple ও log return গণনা করুন, স্পষ্টভাবে উল্লেখিত frequency assumption-এর অধীনে গড় ও volatility annualize করুন এবং arithmetic ও geometric annualized performance তুলনা করুন। অনুপস্থিত তারিখ ও corporate-action treatment পরীক্ষা করুন।",
  "html:Daily returns are far from normal: excess kurtosis is about 8, and there were 32 days with moves beyond four standard deviations, where a normal distribution predicts 0.3. The three worst days all fell in autumn 2008. Returns themselves have small (slightly negative) autocorrelations, but squared returns are strongly autocorrelated: large moves cluster in time. Returns are close to unpredictable; risk is highly predictable. This is the motivation for GARCH models (Lectures 13 and 15) and for fat-tailed risk measures.": "일별 수익률은 정규분포와 크게 다르다. 초과첨도는 약 8이며, 정규분포에서는 0.3일로 예상되는 4 표준편차 초과 움직임이 32일 발생했다. 가장 큰 세 번의 하락은 모두 2008년 가을에 집중되었다. 수익률 자체의 자기상관은 작고 약간 음수이지만, 제곱수익률은 강한 자기상관을 보인다. 큰 변동이 시간적으로 군집한다는 뜻이다. 수익률 자체는 예측하기 어렵지만 위험은 상당히 예측 가능하다. 이것이 GARCH 모형(강의 13 및 15)과 두꺼운 꼬리 위험측정의 동기이다.",
  "html:An investment pays 120 or 80 with equal probability. Compute expected payoff and variance. For logarithmic utility, compare expected utility with utility at expected wealth to establish the certainty-equivalent relation.": "투자수익이 동일한 확률로 120 또는 80이라고 하자. 기대수익과 분산을 계산한다. 로그 효용함수에서 기대효용과 기대부에서의 효용을 비교하여 확실성등가 관계를 확인한다."
}
